==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.33~1.33 seconds<sup>10f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**20 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is one of the hardest in the sub-chapter, due to the combination of Gory Darks and Sunfish Jones. Spammable attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] are recommended against the Gories. Stall first, then send your attackers out. [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave]]/[[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge]] units help immensely if you choose to rush Sunfish Jones, but otherwise, keep a steady flow of cats to chip at the boss. If you are struggling with Elizabeth, get more [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]].

